KaTeX 0.16.11
-------------
https://katex.org · https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX

KaTeX typesets every equation in the artifact. It is inlined, minified, into
build/src/30_katex.js and build/src/20_katex.css, and from there into
dist/Digital_Communications.html. The minified build carries no comment of
its own, so its notice is reproduced here in full.

