The twenty KaTeX font faces are embedded in build/src/20_katex.css as base64
woff2 data, which is why the artifact typesets mathematics with no network.
They are redistributed as part of the KaTeX release above and under the same
notice. Parts of that font work descend from Computer Modern and are noted
upstream under the SIL Open Font Licence 1.1 (https://scripts.sil.org/OFL);
if you extract the font files on their own rather than as part of KaTeX,
check the upstream terms for the face you are taking.


